\n血も魂も——全部、君のためにあるんだ。\n\n僕の人生は、きっと最初から君のものだった。\n\nこのステージでの演奏も、君に届いてほしい気持ちなんだ。\nだから……お願い、僕だけを見てて。」\n\n② the female character that he plays on the stage\n「たとえ隣にいられなくても、私の心はずっとあなたのそばにいる。もう、同じ景色を一緒に見られなくてもいい。\nただ――あなたが幸せでいてくれたら、それだけでいいの。\n\nそれでも……本当は、もう一度だけ、あなたの名前を呼びたかった。」\n\nSorry for such a complicated request. Thank you very much in advance 🙏", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shimamura_ko/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3779183, "client_id": 3692649, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/142b5dc3-4448-431a-af62-86ff703ecf09?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1785559997&Signature=ii6UxVFRqu7OVeffXR9kAL9lcbb6rpS9uY22-dK~dy43h2b2o3VQSrdrX1Bi-teZC06EZl0FNIBATQ6HJhKtZq2z04rsKjoqLPcmj3C4f9wBJYMLJcPutbhWSSjBZzhVPsFGZl-i-xL1Ex4fmTC~sTWJjQQKVfQHcW4LHc0gLwaZD6qa8nCI4YXu9fNRtkCqViK0yQYYflewkGf1EbYn89nJ9FGIej9~tJ3i80N0nZDL24VHu1hdBFnOlQJ5zevedByLd-~DCLfZitAh7IkOkA~9iMmms0wvc77wPSGbsBH5ZHVqf86ad-BvL0THSnCbzmdorZZ5r0bU4raxsHBAAw__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb2ec4df053b5efc3b152b5a7cd459e", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb2ec4df053b5efc3b152b5a7cd459e, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecb1dfa2946917b2b7735fd0f310529c 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=